# General Rules

- Before generating code, read the project rules that apply:
  - [project-design.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/project-design.mdc) for architecture context
  - [project-conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/project-conventions.mdc) for coding conventions
  - [ui-ux-design-guidelines.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/ui-ux-design-guidelines.mdc) for frontend styling
  - [view_conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/view_conventions.mdc) and [vue_conventions.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/vue_conventions.mdc) for Vue/Nuxt usage
  - [testing.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/testing.mdc) when writing tests

- Hardcode strings in English for now; do not introduce i18n scaffolding.
- Prefer existing patterns and utilities over introducing new dependencies.

## Prohibited Actions

- Do not run dev servers (`pnpm dev`, `nest start`, `nuxt dev`) unless explicitly asked.
- Do not run database migrations or schema sync unless explicitly asked.
- Do not change production configuration or secrets.
